687","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/295db2aa61bd947e1a4ff8982c67f1cb41fec62c/ss_295db2aa61bd947e1a4ff8982c67f1cb41fec62c.600x338.jpg?t=1768050687"}],"short_description":"An Action-Puzzle game where the level HIDES when you move! Scan the stage, plan your path, then leap into darkness with lurking enemies on your tail and massive boss fights blocking your way out. Are you ready to get lost in the dark?!","steam_appid":3055110,"support_info":{"email":"DerghamGames-ask@outlook.com","url":"https://www.instagram.com/dergham.games/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Arabic, Dutch","type":"game","website":null}